sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Your app
    participant P as Platform API
    Note over A,P: A. Polling: your app is the CLIENT and keeps asking
    A->>P: GET /v1/messages?roomId=room-poll
    P-->>A: 200 {"items": []}  (nothing new)
    A->>P: GET /v1/messages?roomId=room-poll
    P-->>A: 200 {"items": []}  (nothing new)
    Note over A,P: event: Alice posts "show version"
    A->>P: GET /v1/messages?roomId=room-poll
    P-->>A: 200 {"items": [msg-0004]}  (noticed up to 1 interval late)
    Note over A,P: B. Webhook: roles flip, the platform is the CLIENT
    A->>P: POST /v1/webhooks {targetUrl, resource, event, secret}  (once)
    P-->>A: 200 {"id": "wh-0001", "status": "active"}
    Note over A,P: event: Alice posts "show ip interface brief"
    P->>A: POST /webhook  (X-Spark-Signature, data.id=msg-0001)
    A-->>P: 200 OK
